"summer_Mon": "Ugh, it's so hot! I hope I remembered to pack enough sunscreen.$2#$e#This weather is too hot for my sensitive skin.",
"summer_Mon2": "I can't wait for the winter.#$b#Why? Because my birthday is coming up!",
