"spiritseve.Shiko_spouse": "I thought I felt something grab my arm...$2",
"spiritseve.Shiko_spouse_y2": "Sunshine, are you going to go to the maze?#$e#I'm amazed by your courage!",
"icefestival.Shiko": "Sneaking off to visit me?#$b#Ha ha! I'm only teasing you.$1",
"icefestival.Shiko_y2": "Too bad I'm not much of a fisherman. I'd be in on it.",
"icefestival.Shiko_spouse": "Are you going to fish, honey?#$b#I'll be cheering you on!$1",
"icefestival.Shiko_spouse_y2": "If you're cold, dear, go warm yourself by the fire.",  
"winterstar.Shiko": "Did Gus have too much to drink? Oh dear...",
"winterstar.Shiko_y2": "Tell me, who are you giving a gift to this year?#$e#Why are you looking at me like that? I won't tell you who I'm giving it to. It's a secret!$1", 
"winterstar.Shiko_spouse": "You brought me a present, @?$h#$b#I already got the best present you could give me though...$l",
"winterstar.Shiko_spouse_y2": "How quickly time flies!#$e#Here we are at the end of the year.#$e#I'm so excited to spend next year with you too!$4", 

//Movies
"movie.sprout.1": "Shall we watch a movie about a sprout?$3#$b#I think it will be interesting!$1",
"movie.sprout.2": "I'm more worried about his fate than mine.$2",
"movie.sprout.3": "Not a bad movie. I even almost cried at one point.#$b#Just don't tell anyone!$8",
"movie.nature.1": "Will this movie show the city of Zuzu?",
"movie.nature.2": "...$2#$b#I'm sorry, I...miss my family.$2",
"movie.praireking.1": "A movie based on the game «Adventures of the Prairie King»?#$b#I've seen Abigail play it a couple times in the saloon.",
"movie.praireking.2": "He can handle everything, can't he?$3",
"movie.praireking.3": "Prairie King is a very savvy marksman!#$b#I think I'll play «Adventures of the Prairie King» someday.",
"movie.comedy.1": "The poster said it was an absurdist movie...$3#$b#Anyway, you invited me, and it isn't polite to refuse...$3",
"movie.comedy.2": "Well... I thought it would be worse...$3#$e#Anyway, thanks for the invite.",
"movie.mysterium.1": "What an enigmatic title...#$b#«Mysterium»...#$e#Should be very interesting!$1",
"movie.mysterium.2": "Is that even a person?$3#$b#I can't get a good look at it.$3",
"movie.mysterium.3": "Who was that?#$b#Hmm... any word on the release of part two?",
"movie.howls.1": "I'm not a big fan of horror movies, but...$2#$b#Along with you... I'd love to see it!",
"movie.howls.2": "...$2#$e#Looks like I won't sleep tonight...$2",
"movie.star.1": "What movie are we going to see? I haven't had a chance to read the poster yet.",
"movie.star.2": "That was a very boring movie...$2#$e#...$2#$e#What?$3",
"movie.romance.1": "I have watched this movie many times with my family.#$e#After school and work, the whole family would settle down on the couch in front of the small TV...",
"movie.romance.2": "It's amazing.#$b#Each time you rewatch the movie, you start to see it differently.",

