"rain.000": "*sigh* You can't do anything in this type of weather...$2#$b#Good thing the saloon is always open.$0",
"summer.000": "I wonder if I should get a tan...$6",
"summer.001": "%Shiko doesn't look like she's in the mood to talk right now.",
"fall.000": "%Shiko doesn't look like she's in the mood to talk right now.",
"fall.001": "This weather is perfect for a nice stroll in the forest.$6",
