"winter.001": "Just doing some cleanup around here.",
"marriage.000": "Hey there, handsome. You taking a break from work?^Hey there, gorgeous. You taking a break from work?#$b#Or did you want to come and see me?$1",

//New Dialogue
"GreenRain": "Is it raining acid rain outside?$3#$b#The townspeople are very concerned.$2#$e#Maybe I shouldn't go out for a smoke either...$2",
"GreenRain_2": "I can't believe I used to really think it was acid rain.$1",
"breakUp": "You want to break up with me?$2#$b#Fine, suit yourself, but know that I don't care!$3#$e#...$2#$e#What more do you need?!$5",
"AcceptGift_(O)StardropTea": "Ohhh, this reminds me of home... thank you, @!",

//Objects
"ShikoHouse.1": "It's a photo of Shiko's family. She's next to a boy and three other girls who are grinning from ear to ear. In the middle is their mother.",
"ShikoHouse.2": "A fashion magazine. The person on the cover looks a lot like Shiko!",
"ShikoHouse.3": "Beer cans.",
"ShikoHouse.4": "A bunch of open envelopes. Most of them are from a single person named 'Junko'.",
"ShikoHouse.5": "To our beloved Shiko-^We miss you and we hope you're doing alright.^Our little brother has gotten used to all the bright lights and cameras since you've been gone. He misses you too, but he won't admit it, haha.^Remember, if things don't work out or you just feel homesick, we'll always be here to welcome you back with open arms.^Make sure to eat healthy and stay hydrated.^Love,^Your family.",
"ShikoHouse.6": "There's something on the radio, but you can't understand what they're saying.",

//Events
//Beach
"event_2hearts_001": "Well hey there, @. Are you here to keep me company?$6",
"event_2hearts_002": "I'm just enjoying the sound of the waves.$6#$b#Now that I think about it, I didn't realize how much I needed a breather.$6",
"event_2hearts_003": "Say, how's that farming life going for you?$6#$b#It must be nice to live on a farm.$6#$b#I used to live in Zuzu City until I decided to ditch that kind of lifestyle.$6",
"event_2hearts_004": "But I'd be lying if I said I didn't miss my family and friends back at home.$6#$b#I probably sound like a selfish brat, but I have to admit that I feel pretty lonely.$6#$b#Despite being surrounded by wonderful people, I guess...$6",
"event_2hearts_005": "#You'll make some new friends here.#...",
"event_2hearts_006": "You're very kind, farmer boy.$6^You're very kind, farmer girl.$6#$b#It's a nice change of pace to meet someone like you, honestly.$6",
"event_2hearts_007": "Let's talk more some other time.$6",
"event_2hearts_008": "Don't be a stranger.$6",
"noResponse_2hearts_001": "Well, enough of me rambling...$6",
"noResponse_2hearts_002": "I'll see you later, farmer boy.$6^I'll see you later, farmer girl.$6",

//Forest
"event_4hearts_001": "Stop right there!$6",
"event_4hearts_002": "Oh, it's you, @!$6#$b#Come over here, I wanna talk to ya'!$6",
"event_4hearts_003": "Good, good. Now stand right there.$6",
"event_4hearts_004": "Hmm...$6",
"event_4hearts_005": "You know what farmer boy?$6^You know what farmer girl?$6#$b#You're really attractive up close!$6",
"event_4hearts_006": "Heh, did I come off too strong just then?$6#$b#But, jokes aside, it's true!$6#$b#You could definitely be a model!$7",
"event_4hearts_007": "I don't know what it is that makes you stand out.$6#$b#Maybe it's your physique? Or maybe it's your strength or your intelligence?$6",
"event_4hearts_008": "Of course!$7#$b#It's obviously your charming personality.$7#$b#Who can resist an alluring person such as yourself? Haha!$6",
"event_4hearts_009": "You know, if your new farming life doesn't pan out as you hoped it would, there's always a place for you in the modeling industry.$6",
"event_4hearts_010": "Oh, looks like it's time for me to go! Gus probably needs help back at the saloon.$6#$b#I'll see you around, farmer boy.$6^I'll see you around, farmer girl.$6#$b#Pay me a visit sometime, okay?$6",

//Saloon
"event_6hearts_001": "Hey there, @, you look good! Did you do something with your hair?$1#$b#Okay, so you always look good, but you look good in the way that something about you is just...$3#$b#Uh... better?$1",
"event_6hearts_002": "How about you let me buy you a beer?",
"event_6hearts_003": "Hey, Gus, let me get a round for me and the farmer boy.^Hey, Gus, let me get a round for me and the farmer girl.",
"event_6hearts_004": "Coming right up.", //Gus
"event_6hearts_005": "There you go, Shiko.$u", //Gus
"event_6hearts_006": "Thank you, Gus!$1#$b#Cheers!$1",
"event_6hearts_007": "Heh. Hey, @, can I tell you something?$1",
"event_6hearts_008": "It's just, I'm loud and pushy and arrogant.#$b#It's got me thinking. Why would someone like you want to be friends with me?",
"event_6hearts_009": "And I know I run my mouth all the time and talk a whole lotta nonsense, but the fact that you still put up with me means a whole lot.#$b#I'm pretty damn lucky to have you as a friend.$1",
"event_6hearts_010": "I'm sorry if I've been rambling. I just get fired up sometimes, ya' know?#$b#It's a real weight off my chest to get to talk to someone.$1#$b#How about I buy us some more beers so we can forget about this nonsense?#$b#Hey Gus! Another round for me 'n @!$1",

//Town
"event_8hearts_001": "Oh it's just you.$9#$b#You're up late.$9",
"event_8hearts_002": "You should head home. You'll get sick in this kind of weather.$9",
"event_8hearts_003": "*sigh* I should have expected that...$9",
"event_8hearts_004": "I'm being selfish. I know I am...$10#$b#You've always been there for me and I don't deserve that from you.$10",
"event_8hearts_005": "I'd like for you to hear me out again...$10",
"event_8hearts_006": "It's just... I've been having some thoughts. Thinking about... things.$10#$b#We've been spending a lot of time together and it's made me think about... well, moments when I've run away.$10",
"event_8hearts_007": "I ran away from my family, my friends... my home.$10#$b#Hell, even ran away from myself.$10#$b#And all for what? Just for me to be happy with myself?$9",
"event_8hearts_008": "*sigh*$10#$b#But for the first time... being with you, things just felt right.$10",
"event_8hearts_009": "I'm sorry if I'm making you uncomfortable.$10",
"event_8hearts_010": "#I feel the same way.#I'm sorry... I don't feel the same way.",
"event_8hearts_011": "Thank you, @.$11#$b#Hearing that coming from someone like you... I don't know if you understand how happy it makes me.$11",
"event_8hearts_012": "Meeting you was probably the best day of my life.$l#$b#It's like I found a part of myself that I was missing.$l",
"event_8hearts_013": "No one like me should be this lucky.$l",
"event_8hearts_014": "Come on, let's get you inside before you catch a cold.$1",
"rejection_8hearts_001": "I'm sorry...$10",
"rejection_8hearts_002": "*sigh* ...I'm gonna head back inside.$2",

//Farm
"event_10hearts_001": "Hey, @.#$b#I'm sorry for bugging you this late at night, but... I wanted to talk to you.",
"event_10hearts_002": "Come on, let's get out of here. I want us to talk somewhere... more private.",
"event_10hearts_003": "Sorry for bringing you out this late.#$b#But I wanted to show you something...#$b#It's not too far.",
"event_10hearts_004": "Oh, the bike?#$b#I'm just... borrowing it for a bit. Don't worry, I left a note for Sebastian.$1",
"event_10hearts_005": "That's Zuzu City in the distance.#$b#I think if I squint hard enough, I could see the apartment I grew up in.",
"event_10hearts_006": "...Can I ask you something, @?",
"event_10hearts_007": "$q -1 null#Would you ever want to come to the city with me?#$r -1 0 event_shiko1#I'd go anywhere with you.#$r -1 10 event_shiko2#Maybe... but not anytime soon.#$r -1 -10 event_shiko3#Sounds boring.",
"event_10hearts_008": "Ever since I moved here a year ago, I've been coming up here to reminisce about the past.#$b#I felt as if I'd never fit in with the townspeople here, so I planned to move back home.#$b#Well, that WAS my plan... until something came in the way.",
"event_10hearts_009": "@...#$b#When I first met you, I was struck by your kindness and by your warmth.$4#$b#It became difficult for me to shut you out of my mind. The more I tried to forget you, the more I began to think about you... Until I realized...",
"event_10hearts_010": "Nobody has ever made me feel the way you make me feel, and that is such a crazy feeling.$4",
 
 //Farmhouse
"event_14hearts_001.0": "...you caught me.$2",
"event_14hearts_001.1": "...I'm so sorry, @. I'm such a coward.$2",
"event_14hearts_001.2": "...I was going to run away. Like I always do.$2",
"event_14hearts_001.3": "It's just... my feelings for you. They're so strong. They get stronger by the day. And it's... it's scaring me!$2",
"event_14hearts_001.4": "I mean, what if I hurt you? I couldn't bear that! Or what if I lose you somehow?! I'd never be okay again!$2",
"event_14hearts_001.5": "Isn't it better if I just leave and save us both any future heartbreak?$2",
"event_14hearts_001.6": "You kiss Shiko and look deep into her eyes.",
"event_14hearts_001.7": "Shiko...",
"event_14hearts_001.8": "Love is about taking those chances, and I would be heartbroken without you. Please don't go.",
"event_14hearts_001.9": "Don't do this to us, Shiko. What we have is too special. We both deserve to be happy, together.",
"event_14hearts_001.10": "...you're right. You're right, of course. You always are.",
"event_14hearts_001.11": "I'm so sorry, @. I won't do this again.$2",
"event_14hearts_001.12": "Let's go home."
}
